{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "c8b832d943e979f90744786e9482805dec71123611ac0d3639a6d479a17490c1", "ja": "抑圧からの解放", "zh": "从压抑中解放", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edbe04dfc18d28f9a4ed21bbe7bf0c6370b186852ee1d6d95e723fd287cc84b4", "ja": "のり子、星梨花、春香たち『本隊』は挨拶に\n迫力を出すため、言葉の組み手で特訓をする\nことに。春香や星梨花に、気持ちを正面から\nぶつけるのり子。受け止めた二人は、自分の\n中に秘めていた思いに気づく。", "zh": "为了让问候更有气势，诺莉子、星梨花、春香等“主力部队”决定通过语言对练进行特训。诺莉子正面向春香和星梨花倾诉自己的心情。接住这份心意的两人，也察觉到了自己内心深处一直隐藏的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "35b367e37837394fba41ee07f18723e58c6b7641c9e1d7254b86b6265cc36fe8", "ja": "（今から、それぞれの陣営に分かれて打ち合わせだ。\nまずは、のり子たちの様子を見てみよう……）", "zh": "（接下来要分成各自的队伍开会。先去看看典子她们的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1001_null", "source_sha256": "8d5ecc8dd8e7d3ad3630ceb0bb358293bf02f23c73af3a38a55a94adea8492bd", "ja": "―都内某所、プロレス団体のジム―", "zh": "——东京都内某处，职业摔跤团体的训练馆——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "1d730f41c76a6c4928f56c72f5badc12f595274cca8e7919839429989437615e", "ja": "どうも、765プロの福田のり子です！\n今日は本隊の応援のために駆け付けました！", "zh": "大家好，我是765职业摔角的福田法子！  \n今天是特地赶来给本队加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "ccc459f28abaca98a53c8883b6f09c2cdf687aa845910ecd573f39716ec7f93c", "ja": "アタシが来たからには、\n反体制派のヤツらに、好き勝手させないよ！", "zh": "既然我来了，就不会让那些反抗势力的家伙们为所欲为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "cc221781e1d08f6f6d24c1d71957239d7bc285eee3eb4bc8fd533cfa949a5dca", "ja": "エースが出るまでもない……アタシが\n相手してやるから、まとめてリングに上がりなっ！", "zh": "还用不着王牌出场……由我来对付你们，一起上擂台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1005_esumitui", "source_sha256": "fc415502808a9337448014d7d8a5cd8d9c43de40386165b5b8472f130e8ab12f", "ja": "おおっ！　福田さん、最初からバッチリですね！\nスゴイな……言うことありません！", "zh": "哦哦！福田小姐，一开始就表现得很棒呢！\n厉害……真是无可挑剔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "81e1d8f71a6b280cb2cd2e7a4c5d12ab02a17e431498f0b98c10928383895b42", "ja": "アイドルにとって、トークスキルも\n重要ですからね！　……っと、次は星梨花の番か。", "zh": "对偶像来说，谈话技巧也很重要呢！……啊，接下来轮到星梨花了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "27a12fed939046cd1377fb448ddabad94b7c1efe49540bf021afb75f26223893", "ja": "こんにちは、箱崎星梨花です！　えっと……\nレスラーのみなさんって、すごいです！", "zh": "大家好，我是箱崎星梨花！那个……\n各位摔跤选手，真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "6fa8f07d168defc0a5f83ee8abf9aacbd0f79cd0eb2fc81ba071ce4613b79379", "ja": "プロレスの技って、とっても痛そうで、\n見ていると、ちょっと怖いんですけど……。", "zh": "职业摔跤的招式看起来好像很痛，\n看着看着，我都有点害怕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e7492bc52395f1875ee7d95cf252ff3c8b38303a7ee42e155328bcbba2907b6", "ja": "でも、みなさん全然平気そうだから、安心して\n見られます！　ケガに気を付けて、戦ってくださいね♪", "zh": "不过，大家看起来都完全没事，我就能放心地观看了！请注意不要受伤，好好战斗哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cbf960bfb4f26b5f523c29f4873d70a37ad01fda1db94dfca8e253efd763c5d1", "ja": "うーん、のり子からのギャップが凄いけど……\nこういう方向性もアリですかね？", "zh": "嗯——不过和典子给人的感觉反差好大……\n这种方向也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1011_esumitui", "source_sha256": "1186028521895cb68376b20bddc09dd96295a5b75cb94a9a4e428aea691dec6c", "ja": "そうですね！　カワイイですし、これはこれで。\n……最後、天海さんですね。", "zh": "是啊！既可爱，这样也挺好的。\n……最后是天海小姐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "ef08a1225dfcff8ac0264cd3973305f66b9108481e984c863ca0cbb20f664fb3", "ja": "みなさん、元気ですかーっ？　\n765プロでアイドルをしています、天海春香です！", "zh": "大家还好吗——！  \n我是隶属于765事务所的偶像，天海春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "67f10957bd4ffe0c712f3d7d3acc034ed6f642a86380be39a9037140470cf8db", "ja": "今日は一緒に、試合を盛り上げていきましょう！\nそれじゃあ、行くぞー！", "zh": "今天让我们一起为比赛加油助威吧！\n那么，要上了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "3453204527c31558b2c89e30042277d2096416e4054391ad2f3f96777e6dd54d", "ja": "……っと、わ、わわっ！？", "zh": "……哎呀，哇、哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1015_se", "source_sha256": "2ae41d9afbec0c6d99535f7267d763166ebc80ccc0d15270d93a64f3bc9f1a6e", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん！", "zh": "噼里啪啦稀里哗啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1016_esumitui", "source_sha256": "8fbc376591301c81bcbc7d4c8102db849f7c8ff7e20003d447dbfe10f48860a3", "ja": "うわーっ！？　天海さん、大丈夫ですか！？", "zh": "哇啊！？　天海小姐，您没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "71eb67bd0be19a11e78ad53f570840b40d5c0bdde4b333af46851cb0833bbcbe", "ja": "いたたた、やっちゃった……\nあ、大丈夫です！　私、慣れてるので……えへへ。", "zh": "好痛痛痛，搞砸了……\n啊，我没事的！我都已经习惯了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1018_esumitui", "source_sha256": "6969d4160fa9d69e501a429a5037efe5c279c571c4322ca0bc34df8afa9fdc33", "ja": "！？　す、すごい！　受け身がうますぎる！", "zh": "！？好、好厉害！受身动作也太熟练了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "65b74daef1268b04f364f01c2a7615f1f9a425224d68e5eedad65e82760c96be", "ja": "春香は、何もないところでも転ぶので……\n毎回、ヒヤッとしますけどね。", "zh": "春香经常在什么都没有的地方摔跤……\n每次都让人捏一把冷汗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "86b853dbd2b3f10bebdff28c1cb61f2b0eead4c540947e35ec10962c182bfdc3", "ja": "さて、一通りやってみましたけど……\nどうですか？", "zh": "那么，基本都试过一遍了……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1021_esumitui", "source_sha256": "b02362471c36d331a72d0bd76f538fa20c8b77c8f35e5f887265d7d143639749", "ja": "うーん、そうですね。\nやっぱり迫力が少し足りないかも……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n果然还是稍微缺乏气势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1022_esumitui", "source_sha256": "60cbecb9deb86764bfb3c862db7b35e35ddea264370de1411f5bf5541ae082e2", "ja": "無理に怖くしなくていいんです。ただ、気迫で\nヒール軍団に押され負けてしまってはいけないので。", "zh": "不用勉强弄得很吓人。只是，不能在气势上被反派军团压倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "b0677f1a205da4603bf3d3a156a70c12459a69e1ee26e1cf9444512426ed7382", "ja": "気迫か……。\nうんうん、たしかにそう！", "zh": "气势吗……。\n嗯嗯，确实如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "f7c1fff31db23c7006b2626e57351b88b17a30ec5061359450ad3be7295513c2", "ja": "試合前のアングルなんだから、\nみんなの心に火を点けるくらい、熱くなきゃ！", "zh": "既然是比赛前的镜头，就得热烈到能点燃大家心中的火焰才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "75c5d978a833083e3cd8ad2ff27884eecd7d0592870eac59e424765ab88c9d4a", "ja": "気迫かぁ……プロレス流のMCを身につけないと。\nその前に私は、足元に気をつけなきゃだけど……。", "zh": "气势啊……看来得学会职业摔跤风格的主持才行。\n不过在那之前，我得先注意脚下才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "8631883917d9614af7c1197368cf84f5efa8ef05ad316109a55f692f5d052e90", "ja": "ううん、難しいです……\nわたし、プロレスは全然見せてもらえなかったので。", "zh": "唔，好难啊……\n因为家里人从来都不让我看职业摔跤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "f14b64e8cdeff125deaf940b31dd3136fee6164a3a066ea513c3a7b4032b37b9", "ja": "今回のお仕事も、危ないからやめなさい！\nって、パパったらうるさくて……もう。", "zh": "这次的工作也因为太危险了，爸爸一直吵着说“快放弃吧！”……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1131728486bacd5bdc6fc3f9a73d178d0efb57b5a373e8614be0cc276a98b89d", "ja": "（この流れは……ちょっと煮詰まっちゃいそうだな。\nよし、だったら……）", "zh": "（这样下去……感觉要陷入僵局了。\n好，那就……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "150b089e3ebbac9d5579afdb89bd262cf009fc4fbd147a89d0e8a6a5864fc609", "ja": "みんな！　一つ提案があるんだけど……\n言葉で組み手をやってみたらどうだ？", "zh": "大家！我有个提议……\n要不要试试用语言来过招？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "2cfab7f7707d6409f81e7283a4c8ca367123ddca9bbe8701d96f2c091f9e10ce", "ja": "えっ、言葉で組み手って……。\nどういうことですか？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "咦？用语言过招是指……  \n具体是什么意思呢？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5d54b3f9c5931c66a0fc89c3a24b5fe5d9bf29e1a1839d276a75251cbd11abf8", "ja": "今みたいに、別々に練習するんじゃなくて、\n言いたいことをぶつけ合ってみたらどうかなって。", "zh": "我想，不如不要像现在这样各自练习，而是试着把想说的话直接说出来、互相交流一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c1f41a5207d83cab77bf5bd6f5fd16caa4fcaac82138d3f2f05a40998c4f20f4", "ja": "まだみんな、お互いに遠慮があるっていうか、\nぎこちない気がしたから。", "zh": "我觉得大家彼此之间还都有些顾虑，感觉相处起来不太自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "d904df57ba8ba1539d45a70018d2e434e2717a1a3a9613fc7afcc86a39ca791c", "ja": "なるほど！　そういうことか……\nうん、アタシ、ちょっと言いたいことあったんだ！", "zh": "原来如此！是这么回事啊……\n嗯，我刚好有些话想说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "61cabe481b34d8cb269c83c92c862d1ad8b51ecf898a35aa65fd1f5fda47bc9d", "ja": "春香！　転んだり、失敗したりはいいよ！\nただ、笑ってごまかす必要はないよ！", "zh": "春香！摔倒啊、失败啊，这些都没关系！\n但是，没必要用笑来掩饰哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "83f01fdc2366be04a045c20baaa76fe3c5d368a41ce6f7ed8319d641aab764bb", "ja": "っ！？　のり子ちゃん……！", "zh": "咦！？典子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "66a0047a589f95a050c0e9b64fde6f3b02fa1d284babf9c9d0f4b0d24e999d93", "ja": "何度失敗したって、付き合う！　ただリングの上では、\n「負けない！」って気持ちでいて欲しいんだ！", "zh": "不管失败多少次，我都会奉陪！不过在擂台上，我希望你能抱着“绝不认输！”的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "09c83e184bbb36d9bf5ed063828e3279eae0ccd3ebdb5121d3645de3ecb4f2a9", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。私にだって、\nそういう気持ちはあるけど、セーブしちゃってたかも。", "zh": "嗯……你说得对呢。我心里其实\n也是有这种想法的，但之前可能一直压抑住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "8a771c312f1bbf07d5268c91d158a9884752cca08236e5ed67dfc5d515017338", "ja": "ありがとう、のり子ちゃん！\nどういう気持ちで挑めばいいか、わかった気がする！", "zh": "谢谢你，法子！\n我好像明白该怀着怎样的心情去挑战了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "5f917bfb0b2b2e64486122ffd5ed20095d39e8dd4458660befd3fbbb7c5faf30", "ja": "うん！　それから……星梨花！　お父さんに\n反対されても、リングに上がるのはどうして？", "zh": "嗯！然后……星梨花！即使爸爸反对，你为什么还要登上擂台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "23c60782a7af681fa13f5210edf941aee5df7374dff200132e0fb2729d50b6a7", "ja": "大事なのはそこだと思う！　星梨花が\nどうしたいのか、星梨花の言葉で語ってみて！", "zh": "我觉得关键就在这里！星梨花你到底\n想怎么做，试着用你自己的话来说说看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "0637deee79daf02ab182b31ca579c0fd8466e5c87f99b9244a6e1c1a23e111f6", "ja": "えっと……わたしは……。", "zh": "那个……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "475e4fb7227c9815871d4d4847f8d030636da0d3c0b1c0dd40bfcb9df2674b3a", "ja": "わたしは……いい子だねって言われるばっかりじゃ\nなくて、それ以外のわたしも見てもらいたいです！", "zh": "我不想只是被说“是个乖孩子”，也想让大家看到其他模样的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "6edb1e1cdc2f4a3899bca4bb8fc0b6a4f15248417cd9830fe883578d993c37f2", "ja": "だからわたしも、強くなりたいなって……あ。\nそっか、この気持ちが大事なんですね！", "zh": "所以我也想变强……啊。  \n原来如此，这份心情才是最重要的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1045_esumitui", "source_sha256": "429b125d1657971f4b3fd1c312dbd54e3551ae628ec7bd40c1a70fbc31ad5144", "ja": "おおっ、なんだか盛り上がってきた……！\nアイドルのみなさんって、熱いんですね！　最高です！", "zh": "哦哦，气氛好像越来越热烈了……！\n偶像们真是热情高涨啊！太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "394627a7181ba9e1f101cdb229d7843adc9e2a9c3119b2d4cf023bbaed5ec759", "ja": "（よし、いいスタートが切れそうだぞ。\nこの勢いで、最後まで突っ走りたいところだな！）", "zh": "（好像能有个不错的开场了。\n真想趁着这股势头，一路冲到最后啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
